lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Generated by `npm run test:coverage`. Tracking it meant every coverage run
# dirtied ~33 files of regenerated HTML, which buried real diffs in review.
coverage

# Generated by `npm run test:mutation` (Stryker) — same reasoning as coverage:
# a regenerated HTML report is not a reviewable diff. `.stryker-tmp` is the
# sandbox Stryker copies the project into; it is pointed at node_modules by
# stryker.conf.json, but keep the root entry in case that is ever changed back.
reports
.stryker-tmp

